  "contentHtml": "\n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Mumbai: <a href=\"/tag/leucine+rich+bio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Leucine Rich Bio</a> has launched the <a href=\"/tag/bugspeaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BugSpeaks</a> <a href=\"/tag/vaginal+microbiome+test\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">vaginal microbiome test</a> as it expands into female reproductive and urogenital health.The microbiome company said the test marks the first vaginal microbiome diagnostic available across South and Middle East Asia and builds on the company’s previous tests, including the BugSpeaks gut microbiome test and facial skin microbiome test.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>According to Leucine, “Women’s reproductive and urogenital health has historically depended on traditional culture methods. These methods frequently fail to capture the full complexity of <a href=\"/tag/microbial+interactions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">microbial interactions</a>. The BugSpeaks vaginal microbiome test evaluates the complete local microbial ecosystem.”</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>“The diagnostic output covers eight sections: core vaginal dysbiosis and infections, reproductive health and fertility, sexually transmitted infection susceptibility, menopausal transitions, microbial composition and predictive pH, functional secretions, the gut-vagina axis, and antimicrobial resistance profiling,” the company added.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Oct 22, 2026 at 12:54 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Oct 22, 2026 at 12:54 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-